1. Functional Requirements

1.1 User Management
User registration and login
JWT-based authentication
Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)
Password reset functionality
Profile management
Session management
Admin user management

1.2 Student Profile Management
Create and update student profiles
Store personal and academic information
Upload resumes
Upload certifications
Add internships
Add projects
Store coding platform profiles
Track semester-wise performance
Maintain placement history

1.3 Data Processing
Validate uploaded data
Clean inconsistent data
Handle missing values
Normalize and transform features
Generate machine learning features
Calculate readiness indicators

1.4 Resume Analysis
Parse PDF/DOC resumes
Extract technical skills
Extract education details
Extract projects
Extract internships
Extract certifications
Calculate resume quality score

1.5 Skill Profiling
Assess technical skills
Assess aptitude performance
Assess communication skills
Generate skill profile
Compare skills with company requirements

1.6 Placement Prediction
Predict placement probability
Predict placement readiness score
Predict company tier suitability
Predict expected salary/package range
Predict placement risk category

1.7 Explainable AI Module
Explain prediction results
Display feature importance
Identify positive contributing factors
Identify negative contributing factors
Visualize SHAP explanations

1.8 Skill Gap Analysis
Identify missing technical skills
Identify weak academic areas
Compare profile with placement requirements
Recommend improvement areas

1.9 Counterfactual Simulation
Perform "What-if" analysis
Simulate improvement scenarios
Estimate placement probability after improvements
Compare multiple scenarios

1.10 AI Career Mentor
Provide personalized career guidance
Recommend learning roadmap
Recommend certifications
Suggest projects
Suggest companies
Generate interview preparation plans
Answer career-related queries using an LLM

1.11 Dashboards & Analytics
Student Dashboard
Placement readiness score
Placement probability
Resume score
Skill radar
Recommendations
Progress tracking
Faculty Dashboard
Student performance overview
At-risk student identification
Batch performance analytics
Student progress monitoring
Placement Cell Dashboard
Placement statistics
Company-wise analytics
Branch-wise analytics
Placement trends
Eligible student lists
Admin Dashboard
User management
System configuration
Audit logs
Analytics reports

1.12 Reports
Export student reports
Export placement reports
Generate PDF reports
Generate Excel reports
Download analytics

1.13 Notification System
Email notifications
Placement alerts
Interview reminders
Profile completion reminders
Recommendation updates

1.14 API Services
RESTful APIs
Secure API access
Request validation
Response validation
Error handling


2. Non-Functional Requirements
Performance
API response time < 500 ms (excluding ML inference)
ML inference time < 3 seconds
Support concurrent users
Efficient database queries
Security
HTTPS communication
JWT authentication
RBAC authorization
BCrypt password hashing
Input validation
SQL injection protection
XSS protection
CSRF protection
Rate limiting
Audit logging
Reliability
99%+ system availability
Automatic error recovery
Database backup
Fault tolerance
Scalability
Modular microservice-ready architecture
Horizontal API scaling
Independent ML service deployment
Redis caching support
Maintainability
Modular backend services
API documentation
Logging and monitoring
Version control
Automated testing
Usability
Responsive web interface
Simple navigation
Role-specific dashboards
Accessible design
Compatibility
Modern web browsers (Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari)
Desktop and tablet support
REST API integration with third-party systems


3. Hardware Requirements
Server
CPU: Quad-core or higher
RAM: 16 GB minimum (32 GB recommended for ML workloads)
Storage: 500 GB SSD minimum
GPU: NVIDIA CUDA-enabled GPU recommended for model training (optional for deployment if inference load is low)
Client
Modern web browser
Stable internet connection
Minimum 4 GB RAM
Screen resolution of at least 1366×768


4. Software Requirements
Frontend
React.js or Next.js
TypeScript
Tailwind CSS
Axios
Chart.js or Recharts
Backend
FastAPI
Python 3.11+
Pydantic
SQLAlchemy
Alembic
Celery (optional for background jobs)
AI/ML
PyTorch
Scikit-learn
SHAP
LIME
Pandas
NumPy
LangChain (for LLM orchestration)
Databases & Storage
PostgreSQL
MongoDB
Redis
FAISS or Pinecone (vector database)
Local or cloud file storage (e.g., AWS S3)
Deployment
Docker
Nginx
GitHub Actions (CI/CD)
Linux (Ubuntu Server)

5. External Integrations (Optional)
GitHub API (project analysis)
LeetCode / GeeksforGeeks / HackerRank profile import (where supported)
Email service (SMTP or SendGrid)
SMS service (Twilio or equivalent)
LLM provider (OpenAI, Anthropic, or open-source models via Ollama/vLLM)
College ERP APIs (student records)
Resume parsing libraries or services